{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_01",
      "hash": "25cbffd4ceb67505",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Heh heh heh...\\nI am Madam Celadon.\\c\\nI am the one who can look into your future\\nand see the encounters that are to come..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_02",
      "hash": "25cbfcd4ceb66fec",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Shall I foresee the Nature of those fateful allies\\nyou have yet to meet?\\c\\nI’ll charge you just ₽10,000.\\nWouldn’t you like to know your fate?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_01",
      "hash": "f7d50e445b3313aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Yes, please!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_02",
      "hash": "f7d50d445b3311f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "No, thanks"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_03",
      "hash": "25cbfdd4ceb6719f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Heh heh heh...\\nIf fate leads you back here, let us meet again."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_04",
      "hash": "25cbfad4ceb66c86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You don’t have enough dough.\\c\\n...Dough means money, kid."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_05",
      "hash": "25cbfbd4ceb66e39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well then, let me ask you a few questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_06",
      "hash": "25cbf8d4ceb66920",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There are five flowers of different colors in front\\nof you. Which flower do you water?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_03",
      "hash": "f7d50c445b331044",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Red"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_04",
      "hash": "f7d50b445b330e91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Yellow"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_05",
      "hash": "f7d50a445b330cde",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Blue"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_06",
      "hash": "f7d509445b330b2b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Green"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_07",
      "hash": "f7d508445b330978",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pink"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub059_select_08",
      "hash": "f7d507445b3307c5",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I want to quit"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_07",
      "hash": "25cbf9d4ceb66ad3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Heh. I see, I see...\\c\\nNow, among the five flowers I mentioned earlier,\\nwhich one will you thin out if you have to?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_08",
      "hash": "25cc06d4ceb680ea",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Understood...\\nNow I will look into your future."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_09",
      "hash": "25cc07d4ceb6829d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Meeting, greeting, every time so fleeting!\\nHello, good-bye, every day beneath the sky!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_13",
      "hash": "25cf85d4ceb98e8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Nay-cha, hey-cha, wouldn’t wanna day-cha!\\nAbra! Kadabra! Nature is so fab-wha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub059_poke_01",
      "hash": "efa0f798896ec0c1",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ABRA: ...Synchero!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_10",
      "hash": "25cf84d4ceb98cdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Fate is guiding your path. The encounters you\\nwill have this day are likely to have...\\r\\nYes! [VAR AMOUNT(0000)][VAR ITEM1(0000)] Nature!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_11",
      "hash": "25cf83d4ceb98b28",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "And now I’ll take your payment.\\nI wish you good fortune."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub059_fortune_12",
      "hash": "25cf86d4ceb99041",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You want to say good-bye? Heh heh heh...\\nThat is also a part of our fate."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub059_poke_02",
      "hash": "efa0f498896ebba8",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "ABRA: ...Syn."
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_059_max",
      "hash": "e3e37ba718a0fadc"
    }
  ]
}
